== (2) hierarchy sizes on one grid (a^-1 = M_Pl nonred) ==
  M*=1.5e+10: L=8.140e+08, z=3 coefficient (M_Pl/M*)^4=4.390e+35 lattice units, (M*/M_Pl)^2 = G_Lif = 1.509e-18
    Z^4 tick (omega<=pi/a): z=3 regime fits only to k_max=(pi M*^2/a)^(1/3)=2.051e+13 GeV = 1.68e-06/a
    continuous-time gravity: z=1 coeff natural only if gravity cutoff < sqrt(4pi M M*)=1.517e+15 GeV; at cutoff M_Pl the loop/tree ratio ~ (M_Pl/that)^4=4.20e+15
    species needed for O(1) induced LV in graviton at M*: N ~ 16pi^2 (M/M*)^2 = 1.05e+20
  M*=2.0e+09: L=6.105e+09, z=3 coefficient (M_Pl/M*)^4=1.389e+39 lattice units, (M*/M_Pl)^2 = G_Lif = 2.683e-20
    Z^4 tick (omega<=pi/a): z=3 regime fits only to k_max=(pi M*^2/a)^(1/3)=5.354e+12 GeV = 4.38e-07/a
    continuous-time gravity: z=1 coeff natural only if gravity cutoff < sqrt(4pi M M*)=5.540e+14 GeV; at cutoff M_Pl the loop/tree ratio ~ (M_Pl/that)^4=2.36e+17
    species needed for O(1) induced LV in graviton at M*: N ~ 16pi^2 (M/M*)^2 = 5.89e+21
